ương do lắc, đâm như vậy là 「虐待性头部外伤」. Đây là nguyên nhân tử vong đứng đầu do chấn thương đầu ở trẻ dưới 2 tuổi. Ở Mỹ, từ 1999 đến 2014, nó gây ra gần 2250 trẻ dưới 5 tuổi tử vong"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Nguồn gốc"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Spies EL, Klevens J (2016). Fatal Abusive Head Trauma Among Children Aged <5 Years — United States, 1999–2014. MMWR 65(20):505-509. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm6520a1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm6520a1"]},"；Choudhary AK 等 (2018). Consensus statement on abusive head trauma in infants and young children. Pediatric Radiology 48(8):1048-1065. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00247-018-4149-1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s00247-018-4149-1"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm6520a1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Liên kết mở nguồn"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Ghi chú sách"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Khi thật sự đến lúc sắp mất kiểm soát, trước tiên hãy đặt con lại 